      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Wouldn't it be nice to have a 'Load in background' option in the client and also a slider for a bandwidth limit in the system menu? The yellow logo could pop up when the download has finished. \nNice to have if you want to explore a few new worlds in one big run. Saves a lot of time on slow connections. Once you enter an interesting new place you select your next destination before you start to explore the world you're in. Once its done downloading you can switch to another world in seconds instead of up to a few minutes. Another nice thing is that nobody has to wait for a few minutes(in the worst case) for his friends on the other end of a portal.\n\nEDIT: Maybe I could put this in as a separate request...?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
