      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree.\nI have a slow internet connection, and unfortunately, if I use VRCHAT during that time, I may have to wait 5 to 10 minutes on the World Road.\nI think it's impossible to save all the world data. However, I am convinced that time can be used more effectively when it becomes possible to download and update only the world with friends or the world that has been set in advance.",
      "viewerReactions": null
